  "limits": [
    "This is a bounded source/capture/archive/link contract, not a full native ABI or runtime certification.",
    "Only the two three-slot NSI Unix arrays and six NSI argument layouts are checked. Other Unix backends and syscall argument arrays remain separate prerequisites.",
    "Class 1010 and win32u slot 1 are bound to reviewed source and compiled reference edges. Their runtime selection and registration are not observed by this tool.",
    "Native FEXCore link evidence covers the FEXBridge host probe. PE xtajit WoW64 execution, guest-window behavior and JIT availability require separate device evidence.",
    "Compilation records and the native receipt must come from the same trusted fresh CI job. These local JSON files are not authenticated attestations.",
